  nonce: a368  # a368
  message: "PRIORITY CHANGED 2026-08-17, on owner authorisation, as part of the P0/P1 sweep. Recording the reasoning here because a re-rank that lives only in conversation is indistinguishable next session from drift.\n\nTHE GATE. This item terminates at WI-kabif's removal authority, which is parked TWICE OVER: (1) a standing owner ruling of DO NOT START, and (2) a pre-registered numeric threshold -- measurement 0001 records that the removal-authority question becomes \"arguable on its merits\" near 80% precision, and states that no reading of the data supports a number near 80% (measured ~41%). So this is parked on a NUMBER, not on effort, and no amount of session time moves it.\n\nP1 -> P3. This is the item the whole chain terminates at, and it is the one most clearly mis-ranked: it is not merely deferred by preference, it is 39 percentage points away from the pre-registered threshold at which it would become arguable at all. P1 asserted it was next; the measurement says it is not close."  # a368
